  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">카<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>닿<ruby style=\"position: relative\">챠<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AFc8X6s0JSo?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"khia\">騎<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">캬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"khā-tah-chiâ\">跤踏車<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">카ˉ닿챠ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sêh’lai sêh’khi khia-gùn’e khā-tah-chiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"tân-thai\">等待<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">下課<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">하코</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tân-thai-lì ha-kho\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"pue\">陪<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">붸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">每工<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뮈ˆ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做陣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">죄`딘-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pue-lì mûi-kâng joè-tin-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"khīn-khīn\">輕輕<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">킨ˉ킨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心內<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"wē\">話<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">웨ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"phoā̰\">伴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">퐐ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">車輦<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">챠ˉ롄`</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">跤踏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">카ˉ닿-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"siâ̰\">聲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khīn-khīn-sīm-lai-wē phoā̰’tio chiā-lièn khā-tah-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hī-bāng\">希望<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寄<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">햐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn’e hī-bāng lông-kià-ti-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">樹頂<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">츄뎽`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鳥仔<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄌᆤˆ아`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">붇ˆ시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"lai\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">偷聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄐᅷˉ턀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chiu-tièng’e jiâu-à pût-si-lai-thāu-thiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"thiā̰\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">談<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">담-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">戀愛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롼애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"khoài-lork\">快樂<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쾌`럭-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">約會<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">역ˆ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thiā̰-lan tam-loan-ai khoài-lork-yôrk-huē’e sīm-jiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">純情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">순졩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"bāng\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"wi\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"mûi-kâng\">每工<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뮈ˆ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">囥<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">킁`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">쟈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn’e sun-jieng-bāng wi-lì mûi-kâng khǹg-ti-jiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歡歡喜喜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">활ˉ활ˉ히ˆ히`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">陪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">붸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做陣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">죄`딘-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hoā̰-hoā̰-hî-hì pue-lì joè-tin-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"sêh\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"sêh\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"sêh\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"sêh\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"ai\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sêh’ah sêh’ah sêh, sêh’tio làn’e ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"tâh\">踏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">닿ˆ</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">아<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"tâh\">踏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">닿ˆ</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">아<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"tâh\">踏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">닿ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"tâh\">踏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">닿ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"chiēng-chûn\">青春<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">期待<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기태ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tâh’ā tâh’ā tâh,